archive=f'''<main class="page"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">#100DaysOfCloudAndSecurity</span><h1>83 days. One evidence trail.</h1><p class="lead">All Day 1–83 routes are present. Twelve early AWS rows remain explicitly unresolved because the canonical ledger does not yet have artifact evidence for their exact topics.</p><input id="q" class="search" placeholder="Search day, topic or phase"><div class="grid">{cards}</div><section class="section"><h2>Roadmap ahead: Days 84–100</h2><div class="grid">{future}</div></section></div></main>'''
